WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.853
Who can see what.

2
00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:08.841
Every entry has an audience, and you choose it when you save.

3
00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:11.678
Only me means exactly that.

4
00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:16.781
No leader can open it, and neither can the instance owner.

5
00:00:17.331 --> 00:00:22.403
Share it with your unit, and it counts on the unit dashboard,

6
00:00:22.403 --> 00:00:26.354
for leaders who can read that unit’s records.

7
00:00:26.904 --> 00:00:33.071
Every entry says who can see it, in plain words, at the top.

8
00:00:33.621 --> 00:00:36.953
Drafts and career plans are never shared.

9
00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:41.828
And every time a leader opens your record, it is logged.
